      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6a4988d6b9e65d9dc149af5a6660f6a38ac5089de17dfd90fa4278ddb8e8a6e7--victims-of-crime-relationship-of-offender-to-victim-selected-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ada5102ff3102afbb1b4bcbec8583c912e1d8428ceedeb3385c2c00277aa08ac | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 2319002637956b14caae5d2d01c892d6e243296bb26a48c4fb7ec4774b87e03f | missing |\n| \"Table 12\" | 5ce9fc17b034da3250e218eeb4d217433cc1b1260fa61de9b3c8d619b8de6d11 | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | de3e9b8e91a5d8b646b91301c37cabe51d4737ce3d8c5e444f75500c098aa571 | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | e0046e6a1b891a99d2533fab5f26b5de657fbcfbae39fb0f65c51d60ccd47d98 | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | f80bb5177e808667ca7848b47f2b9b35f082421c48e3bc8a3a4b3b872494b450 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 051ebd7dd113ea70e586a0bc9b2fab0177df45dc2eac6d67704cf3953be8d435 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
